# Storefront UI (byzmo-v2/web)

Before storefront UI work in `byzmo-v2/web`:

1. Read `.cursor/docs/ui/ui-brief.md`
2. Use files in `.cursor/docs/ui/references/` as the **visual source of truth** (user-provided mockups)
3. Follow the active module checklist under `.cursor/docs/<module>/checklist.md` (e.g. `.cursor/docs/catalog/checklist.md`, `.cursor/docs/cart/checklist.md`)

Do not invent a competing design once references exist. Preserve API contracts and legacy workflows.
